    // --- BB2020 gap-fill: Giant Mercenary ---
    // LOW CONFIDENCE: Giant Mercenary is a Blood Bowl 2020 mercenary/star
    // player (Death Zone Season 2 "Mercenaries" chapter), not covered by any
    // PDF or physical rulebook available for this task. This is the classic
    // "Giant" big-guy line (MA 3/ST 9/AG 5+/AV 9+, no throwing skill) carried
    // forward from earlier editions, transcribed here from general series
    // knowledge rather than the BB2020 source text -- move/strength/agility/
    // armour should be spot-checked against the physical supplement. `passing`
    // is doubly uncertain: BB2020 requires a numeric Passing target for every
    // entry, but Giants have no passing skill in any edition, so 6 is an
    // inferred worst-case placeholder, not a transcribed value.
    { position: { system: 'Name', id: 'Giant Mercenary' }, rulesSet: { system: 'Name', id: 'BB2020' }, move: 3, strength: 9, agility: 5, passing: 6, armour: 9 },
